1
00:00:03,351 --> 00:00:04,468
Don’t touch the sky.

2
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:08,617
It touches back.

3
00:00:43,484 --> 00:00:46,595
Midnight on my knuckles, city in my teeth

4
00:00:46,994 --> 00:00:50,426
I breathe in the static, exhale something sweet

5
00:00:50,823 --> 00:00:54,095
Streetlights do the waltz, halos in a blur

6
00:00:54,335 --> 00:00:57,845
I’m a little bit holy, I’m a little bit hurt

7
00:00:58,404 --> 00:01:01,515
Every sign says “stop,” but my pulse says “go”

8
00:01:01,356 --> 00:01:05,140
I learned how to fly from a radio

9
00:01:05,903 --> 00:01:09,495
If you wanna find me, follow where it stings—

10
00:01:09,415 --> 00:01:12,527
I'm the quiet before the chrome-winged thing

11
00:01:12,766 --> 00:01:16,197
Hands up, no fear, let the whole world spin

12
00:01:16,596 --> 00:01:20,105
I don't need a map when the bass kicks in

13
00:01:20,426 --> 00:01:23,697
If you hear that spark in the afterglow

14
00:01:24,813 --> 00:01:27,048
That’s my name in the waveform

15
00:01:27,447 --> 00:01:31,436
We go neon, neon — over the edge

16
00:01:32,073 --> 00:01:35,823
Heart like a piston, foot on the ledge

17
00:01:35,903 --> 00:01:39,176
No sleep, no leash, no prayer I won’t break

18
00:01:39,653 --> 00:01:43,962
Hold me like a secret, love me like a quake

19
00:01:44,201 --> 00:01:46,834
Neon, neon — straight through the night

20
00:01:47,394 --> 00:01:49,867
We don’t fall down, we ignite

21
00:01:49,706 --> 00:01:54,415
If the dark wants blood, let it take my doubt

22
00:01:55,132 --> 00:01:58,563
’Cause when the drop hits, I’m out

23
